"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Both sides are making progress in talks to agree on a new shipping route through the strait, but it is still unclear if they will reach a breakthrough.\",            \"english_title\": \"Progress in Shipping Talks\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los dos lados est\u00e1n avanzando en las conversaciones para acordar una nueva ruta de env\u00edo por el estrecho, pero a\u00fan no est\u00e1 claro si llegar\u00e1n a un gran acuerdo.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Progreso en Conversaciones de Env\u00edo\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The vote confirms Trump's former criminal defense lawyer as the top law enforcement official in the country, despite some Republicans opposing it.\",            \"english_title\": \"Trump's Lawyer Confirmed\",            \"translated_version\": \"La votaci\u00f3n confirma al ex abogado defensor de Trump como el principal oficial de la ley en el pa\u00eds, a pesar de que algunos republicanos se oponen.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Abogado de Trump Confirmado\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Lawmakers and police officers had to step in after Alliance party MP Time Kadrijaj threw at least four eggs at Kosovo's acting prime minister Albin Kurti.\",            \"english_title\": \"Eggs Thrown at Prime Minister\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los legisladores y polic\u00edas tuvieron que intervenir despu\u00e9s de que el diputado del partido Alianza, Time Kadrijaj, lanzara al menos cuatro huevos al primer ministro en funciones de Kosovo, Albin Kurti.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Huevos Lanzados al Primer Ministro\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Police in Paris are tightening rules for riders after a sharp increase in deadly accidents.\",            \"english_title\": \"Paris Tightens Rider Rules\",            \"translated_version\": \"La polic\u00eda en Par\u00eds est\u00e1 haciendo m\u00e1s estrictas las reglas para los conductores despu\u00e9s de un gran aumento en accidentes mortales.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Par\u00eds Endurece Reglas para Conductores\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Italy has introduced border controls after about 78,000 migrants from Morocco arrived in the neighboring Spanish exclave of Ceuta.\",            \"english_title\": \"Italy Introduces Border Controls\",            \"translated_version\": \"Italia ha introducido controles fronterizos despu\u00e9s de que unos 78,000 migrantes de Marruecos llegaran a la vecina exclave espa\u00f1ola de Ceuta.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Italia Introduce Controles Fronterizos\"        }    ]}"